### v 1.0
Released

### v 1.0.1 
Add Gaussian Blur 

### v 1.0.2
Adjust Blur Function.

### v 1.0.3
Add rain effect to glass shader

### v 1.1.0
- Physical refraction (Snell's law) with Thin Pane / Solid models
- Dispersion from the Abbe number (replaces the fixed-pixel chromatic offset)
- Two-surface Fresnel energy; fixes reflections being applied twice (reflections are now brighter; lower Environment Reflection Strength toward 1 if needed)
- Box-projected reflection probes
- Internal Scattering property
- Baked mesh thickness (UV5) in the edge baker; bounds fallback is ignored when it does not fit the mesh
- New `refiaa/glass (Shared Grab)` shader: one screen copy per frame
- Performance: fewer texture fetches and cheaper blur
- Fixes: edge baker re-baking baked meshes and dropping blend shapes; unbaked meshes reading garbage edge/thickness data